§ `Part VI - Miscellaneous`

§§§ `82. Contracting out`

DECLARE `contracting out arrangement` HAS
    `the agreement or arrangement is inconsistent with a provision of this Act or purports to exclude, modify or restrict the operation of this Act` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a right conferred by or under this Act is purportedly waived` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a person has entered into an agreement or arrangement with intent either directly or indirectly to defeat, evade or prevent the operation of this Act` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the inconsistency, exclusion, modification, restriction or waiver is provided under this Act` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref Residential Tenancies Act 1987 (WA) s.82(1)
@export Decide whether an agreement, arrangement or waiver is void under s.82(1)
GIVEN a IS A `contracting out arrangement` @desc TRUE if, except as provided under this Act, the arrangement is inconsistent with this Act or purports to exclude, modify or restrict it, or a right conferred by or under this Act is purportedly waived. Void only to that extent.
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the agreement arrangement or waiver is void and of no effect to that extent` IF
        NOT a's `the inconsistency, exclusion, modification, restriction or waiver is provided under this Act`
    AND (
            a's `the agreement or arrangement is inconsistent with a provision of this Act or purports to exclude, modify or restrict the operation of this Act`
        OR  a's `a right conferred by or under this Act is purportedly waived`
        )

@ref Residential Tenancies Act 1987 (WA) s.82(2)
@export Decide whether a person must not enter into the arrangement under s.82(2)
GIVEN a IS A `contracting out arrangement` @desc TRUE if a person has entered into an agreement or arrangement with intent either directly or indirectly to defeat, evade or prevent the operation of this Act.
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the person must not enter into the agreement or arrangement` IF
    a's `a person has entered into an agreement or arrangement with intent either directly or indirectly to defeat, evade or prevent the operation of this Act`

§§ `Fixtures`

`waiver of quiet enjoyment` MEANS `contracting out arrangement` WITH
    `the agreement or arrangement is inconsistent with a provision of this Act or purports to exclude, modify or restrict the operation of this Act` IS FALSE,
    `a right conferred by or under this Act is purportedly waived` IS TRUE,
    `a person has entered into an agreement or arrangement with intent either directly or indirectly to defeat, evade or prevent the operation of this Act` IS FALSE,
    `the inconsistency, exclusion, modification, restriction or waiver is provided under this Act` IS FALSE

#EVAL `the agreement arrangement or waiver is void and of no effect to that extent` `waiver of quiet enjoyment`
#ASSERT `the agreement arrangement or waiver is void and of no effect to that extent` `waiver of quiet enjoyment` EQUALS TRUE
